<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Dispute #{{disputeId}} of swap <a
  href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">#{{orderId}}</a> has
been executed.
{{#ifEquals outcome 'Release'}}
  The swap order has been <b>released</b> - The locked asset has been
  <b>released</b>.
{{/ifEquals}}
{{#ifEquals outcome 'Cancel'}}
  The swap order has been <b>cancelled</b> - The locked asset and liquidity
  have been returned.
{{/ifEquals}}
{{#ifEquals outcome 'Stalled'}}
  The dispute <b>stalled</b>. The swap participants can create an appeal
  immediately.
  {{appealPhaseHoursLeft}}.
{{/ifEquals}}

<br><br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">How Disputes Work</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
